{
  "slug": "sokosumi",
  "name": "Sokosumi",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code plugin for Sokosumi agents, coworkers, tasks, jobs, and marketplace workflows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `agents` (Browse, search, inspect, or hire Sokosumi marketplace agents through MCP), `elena` (Create or inspect Elena coworker tasks in Sokosumi), `hannah` (Create or inspect Hannah coworker tasks in Sokosumi), `install-shortcuts` (Install optional bare Sokosumi skill aliases such as /hannah, /elena, /research, /market, /agents, /jobs, /tasks, and /watch), `jobs` (Check Sokosumi jobs, job events, outputs, files, links, and pending input requests), `market` (Start a Sokosumi marketing or market-analysis workflow), `reseach` (Typo alias for the Sokosumi research workflow), `research` (Start a Sokosumi research workflow), and 4 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `sokosumi`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sokosumi@claude-community` from `masumi-network/Sokosumi-MCP`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
